      "frontLabel": "Hierarchy of Controls",
      "backDefinition": "A framework that prioritizes ways to reduce or remove workplace hazards and exposures.",
      "whyItMatters": "It guides control selection toward methods that reduce reliance on individual worker action.",
      "keyPoint": "Prefer controls that act on the hazard before relying on PPE.",
